{
  "$comment": [
    "Every route the Next.js app serves, and whether the Rust web Worker serves it yet (mukoko-dev/mukoko-weather#579, #475).",
    "pattern: the route in Next.js syntax ([param], [...rest], [[...rest]]). next_file: the file in src/app that makes it (sw.ts is built to /sw.js; robots.ts and sitemap.ts are metadata routes).",
    "status: migrated (the build has the page: asset names the file) or not_migrated (only Next.js serves it: the Worker answers a 404 problem+json, or forwards to LEGACY_ORIGIN when the deployment names one). phase: the phase of #475 that moves it.",
    "A test in weather-core lists src/app and fails when a route is missing from here or no longer exists. astro_only: pages in the Astro build with no Next.js route. Flip a route to migrated in the same PR that adds its page; astro/src/lib/routes.ts must agree (a test checks)."
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "routes": [
    {
      "pattern": "/",
      "next_file": "src/app/page.tsx",
      "status": "not_migrated",
      "phase": "1"
    },
    {
      "pattern": "/[location]",
      "next_file": "src/app/[location]/page.tsx",
      "status": "not_migrated",
      "phase": "1"
